  "design": {
    "decision": "Win tricks with low cards when possible: ruff with low [♠]s and cash low cards after opponents shed a suit.",
    "opponent": "Revealed on the first low win; opponents can overruff low trumps or keep the suit alive so low cards never win.",
    "rationale": "Moves to the standard [2]-through-[6] range; the slightly larger amount offsets the narrower filter.",
